 ing environment' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cloud $ ciamCloudProvider
  $ ciamRegion ) MAY ( ciamCloudEnvironment $ ciamLifecycle ) X-ORIGIN 'opsd
 ir' )
