 ef MAY ( ciamIdentityKind $ ciamGrant $ ciamTrustedBy $ ciamDenial $ ciamBo
 undary $ ciamEvaluated ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.72 NAME 'ciamGuardrail' DESC 'An orga
 nization guardrail over an environment and what it prevents (kept by the la
 nding zone)' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamGuardrailKind MAY ( ciamPr
 oviderRef $ ciamDenies $ ciamDenial $ ciamBoundary ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.73 NAME 'ciamAccessPath' DESC 'How op
 erators come into an environment: single sign-on, a session manager, a bast
 ion, a proxy, just-in-time elevation' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamA
 ccessKind MAY ( ciamProviderRef $ ciamTrustedBy $ ciamGrant ) X-ORIGIN 'ops
 dir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.74 NAME 'ciamTrafficPolicy' DESC 'How
  traffic reaches the servers behind service names: TLS handling and level, 
 health checks, stickiness, timeouts' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ 
 ciamServiceRole $ ciamTlsMode ) MAY ( ciamTlsMinVersion $ ciamTlsProfile $ 
 ciamBackendValidation $ ciamHealthProtocol $ ciamHealthPath $ ciamHealthInt
 ervalSeconds $ ciamHealthyThreshold $ ciamUnhealthyThreshold $ ciamStickine
 ss $ ciamStickinessSeconds $ ciamIdleTimeoutSeconds $ ciamDrainSeconds $ ci
 amEndpointPath ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.75 NAME 'ciamProtectionPolicy' DESC '
 What protects service names: web application firewall rules and rate limits
 , address and country rules, DDoS protection, a CDN' SUP ciamObject STRUCTU
 RAL MUST ( cn $ ciamServiceRole ) MAY ( ciamWafMode $ ciamWafCategory $ cia
 mRateLimit $ ciamIpRule $ ciamGeoRule $ ciamWafExclusion $ ciamDdosTier $ c
 iamCdn $ ciamEndpointPath ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.76 NAME 'ciamHeaderContract' DESC 'A 
 header someone sets and applications or products trust: header-based sign-o
 n, the client address behind a proxy' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $
  ciamHeaderName $ ciamHeaderKind $ ciamSetByRole ) MAY ( ciamTrustedByRole 
 $ ciamTrustedByConsumer $ ciamHeaderValue $ ciamStripsInbound ) X-ORIGIN 'o
 psdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.77 NAME 'ciamDnsZoneBinding' DESC 'A 
 DNS zone the environment publishes in, and who runs it when not the platfor
 m' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ( ciamDnsZone $ ciamZoneVisibility ) MAY
  ( ciamProviderRef $ ciamManagedBy ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.78 NAME 'ciamDnsRecord' DESC 'A DNS r
 ecord beyond the service names (verification, mail, delegation), with its T
 TL and routing' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ( ciamRecordName $ ciamReco
 rdType ) MAY ( ciamRecordValue $ ciamTtlSeconds $ ciamRoutingPolicy $ ciamR
 outingWeight $ ciamDnsZone $ ciamProviderRef ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.79 NAME 'ciamDnsForwarder' DESC 'A co
 nditional forwarder or resolver rule: the domains it forwards and the resol
 vers it forwards to' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ( ciamForwardDomain $ 
 ciamForwardTarget ) MAY ( ciamForwardDirection $ ciamProviderRef ) X-ORIGIN
  'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.80 NAME 'ciamEdgeService' DESC 'A web
  application firewall, CDN, DDoS protection, API gateway or reverse proxy i
 n front of service names, and what it runs' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST
  ciamEdgeKind MAY ( ciamServiceRole $ ciamProviderRef $ ciamEdgeFact $ ciam
 EdgeSetting ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
